<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1323987109"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440833610"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="God Damnit"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Call Me Karizma"/><amll:meta key="album" value="God Damnit"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:32.032"><div begin="00:00.100" end="03:32.032"><p begin="00:00.100" end="00:04.504" itunes:key="L334">If there's a God, why'd he make me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 他为什么要创造我</span></p><p begin="00:05.073" end="00:09.473" itunes:key="L335">All of these flaws is all that I see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只看到 这个满身瑕疵的人</span></p><p begin="00:10.082" end="00:14.528" itunes:key="L336">If there's a God, I don't believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 我难以置信</span></p><p begin="00:14.888" end="00:21.761" itunes:key="L337">Someone as perfect as you would love me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你这样完美无瑕的人才会爱我</span></p><p begin="00:23.127" end="00:25.540" itunes:key="L338">Praying to a ghost, hoping he gets it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像幽灵祈祷 希望他能听到</span></p><p begin="00:25.550" end="00:28.066" itunes:key="L339">The last three girls I fucked didn't listen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和我缠绵过的女孩 她们不理会我</span></p><p begin="00:28.076" end="00:30.679" itunes:key="L340">The last two pills I took haven't kicked in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我吞下的药片 还没有起作用</span></p><p begin="00:30.689" end="00:33.127" itunes:key="L341">Having these one night stands with addiction<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在药效的影响下 我每晚都很风流快活</span></p><p begin="00:33.137" end="00:35.687" itunes:key="L342">Now I gotta catch a red-eye to Michigan<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 我搭上夜间航班 飞到密歇根州</span></p><p begin="00:35.697" end="00:38.177" itunes:key="L343">Playing a show, then a girl that I'm getting with<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">搞场演出 再泡个妞</span></p><p begin="00:38.187" end="00:40.661" itunes:key="L344">Fuck it, I'm young, I can act like an idiot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我年少无知 懵懵懂懂</span></p><p begin="00:40.671" end="00:43.003" itunes:key="L345">How many sins I gotta make till I get the hint?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还要走过多少弯路 才能得到一点点启示</span></p><p begin="00:43.013" end="00:46.323" itunes:key="L2093">But shit it's 4 AM, pouring rain out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在是凌晨四点 外面大雨滂沱</span></p><p begin="00:46.333" end="00:48.812" itunes:key="L2054">Bored again, so I break down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心烦意乱 我心情崩溃</span></p><p begin="00:48.822" end="00:52.800" itunes:key="L2016">Go and send more than "hey" now, now (Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想和你促膝长谈 不是随便敷衍几句</span></p><p begin="00:53.006" end="00:54.685" itunes:key="L1979">I fucked up, of course I did<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我搞砸了一切 全是我的错</span></p><p begin="00:54.695" end="00:58.787" itunes:key="L2213">The more I think now, I should quit, forfeit the crown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我思绪万千</span></p><p begin="00:58.797" end="01:02.293" itunes:key="L2172">Give this up to not let you down again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不让你失望 我放弃一切</span></p><p begin="01:02.614" end="01:06.987" itunes:key="L346">If there's a God, why'd he make me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 他为什么要创造我</span></p><p begin="01:07.585" end="01:12.002" itunes:key="L347">All of these flaws is all that I see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只看到 这个满身瑕疵的人</span></p><p begin="01:12.594" end="01:17.035" itunes:key="L348">If there's a God, I don't believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 我难以置信</span></p><p begin="01:17.436" end="01:24.123" itunes:key="L349">Someone as perfect as you would love me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你这样完美无瑕的人才会爱我</span></p><p begin="01:27.564" end="01:31.576" itunes:key="L4277">God damn me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="01:32.563" end="01:36.492" itunes:key="L4232">I want you, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="01:37.578" end="01:41.507" itunes:key="L4188">God damn me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="01:42.552" end="01:46.679" itunes:key="L4145">I want you, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="01:48.156" end="01:50.676" itunes:key="L350">Baby, you're a ghost, why are you missing?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 你是幽灵吗 为什么神出鬼没</span></p><p begin="01:50.686" end="01:53.198" itunes:key="L351">Maybe 'cause I haven't hit you back in a minute<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许因为我没有及时回你的电话</span></p><p begin="01:53.208" end="01:55.573" itunes:key="L352">Maybe 'cause I flirt with every girl in existence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许因为我和每个女孩眉来眼去</span></p><p begin="01:55.583" end="01:58.051" itunes:key="L353">I blame it on distance, that I'm being distant<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的感情破碎都是距离的错 是我离得太远了</span></p><p begin="01:58.061" end="02:00.659" itunes:key="L354">But I don't fucking care, I gotta sing to these kids quick<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我毫不在意 我得赶紧给粉丝们唱歌</span></p><p begin="02:00.669" end="02:03.152" itunes:key="L355">I remember never having fans that would listen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我记得从来没有歌迷愿意听我的歌</span></p><p begin="02:03.162" end="02:05.544" itunes:key="L356">Now I got a thousand every city I visit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我去过很多地方</span></p><p begin="02:05.554" end="02:08.015" itunes:key="L357">It's just that you ain't here now and I miss it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是到处都没有你的踪迹 我好想你</span></p><p begin="02:08.025" end="02:11.306" itunes:key="L358">But shit, it's 4 AM, pouring rain out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在是凌晨四点 外面大雨滂沱</span></p><p begin="02:11.316" end="02:13.814" itunes:key="L359">Bored again, so I break down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心烦意乱 我心情崩溃</span></p><p begin="02:13.824" end="02:17.587" itunes:key="L360">Go and send more than "hey" now, now (Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想和你促膝长谈 不是随便敷衍几句</span></p><p begin="02:18.021" end="02:19.663" itunes:key="L361">I fucked up, of course I did<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我搞砸了一切 全是我的错</span></p><p begin="02:19.673" end="02:23.800" itunes:key="L362">The more I think now, I should quit, forfeit the crown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我思绪万千</span></p><p begin="02:23.810" end="02:27.440" itunes:key="L364">Give this up to not let you down again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不让你失望 我放弃一切</span></p><p begin="02:27.600" end="02:31.985" itunes:key="L365">If there's a God, why'd he make me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 他为什么要创造我</span></p><p begin="02:32.588" end="02:37.012" itunes:key="L366">All of these flaws is all that I see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只看到 这个满身瑕疵的人</span></p><p begin="02:37.610" end="02:42.004" itunes:key="L367">If there's a God, I don't believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的有上帝 我难以置信</span></p><p begin="02:42.416" end="02:49.457" itunes:key="L368">Someone as perfect as you would love me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像你这样完美无瑕的人才会爱我</span></p><p begin="03:07.579" end="03:09.452" itunes:key="L8427">God damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="03:12.533" end="03:16.574" itunes:key="L6938">God damn me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="03:17.556" end="03:21.601" itunes:key="L6890">I want you, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="03:22.582" end="03:26.703" itunes:key="L6843">God damn me, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p><p begin="03:27.522" end="03:32.032" itunes:key="L6797">I want you, god damnit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真该死</span></p></div></body></tt>